#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL"
msgid ""
"STEAMWORKS ONLY:\n"
"Maximum number of incoming Steam networking messages processed per poll tick on the server.\n"
"Higher values reduce latency spikes under heavy traffic but may increase CPU usage per frame.\n"
"Lower values improve frame stability but can increase message backlog and delay processing during bursts.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended range: 32â128 (default: 128)"
msgstr ""
"NUR STEAMWORKS:\n"
"Maximale Anzahl eingehender Steam-Netzwerknachrichten, die pro Tick auf dem Server verarbeitet werden.\n"
"Höhere Werte verringern Latenzspitzen bei starkem Netzwerkverkehr, können aber die CPU-Auslastung pro Frame erhöhen.\n"
"Niedrigere Werte verbessern die Frame-Stabilität, können aber bei Lastspitzen zu Verzögerungen führen.\n"
"\n"
"Empfohlener Bereich: 32–128 (Standard: 128)"

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SAVE_FILE_TRANSFER_CHUNK
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SAVE_FILE_TRANSFER_CHUNK
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SAVE_FILE_TRANSFER_CHUNK
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SAVE_FILE_TRANSFER_CHUNK"
msgid ""
"Size (in kilobytes) of each data chunk used when transferring save files over the network.\n"
"Smaller values reduce bandwidth spikes and improve reliability on unstable connections but increase transfer time due to more packets.\n"
"Larger values speed up transfers but may cause higher bandwidth bursts or fragmentation.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended range: 16â256 KB (default: 256 KB)."
msgstr ""
"Größe (in Kilobyte) jedes Datenblocks bei der Übertragung von Speicherständen über das Netzwerk.\n"
"Kleinere Werte verringern Bandbreitenspitzen und verbessern die Zuverlässigkeit bei instabilen Verbindungen, erhöhen jedoch die Übertragungszeit.\n"
"Größere Werte beschleunigen Übertragungen, können jedoch zu Fragmentierung führen.\n"
"\n"
"Empfohlener Bereich: 16–256 KB (Standard: 256 KB)."

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.HARD_SYNC_AT_CYCLE_START
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.HARD_SYNC_AT_CYCLE_START
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.HARD_SYNC_AT_CYCLE_START
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.HARD_SYNC_AT_CYCLE_START"
msgid ""
"Perform a hard sync at the start of every new cycle\n"
"\n"
"Does not use up your one hard sync per cycle"
msgstr ""
"Führt zu Beginn jedes neuen Zyklus eine Hart-Synchronisation durch.\n"
"\n"
"Verbraucht nicht Ihre manuelle Hart-Synchronisation pro Zyklus."

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS"
msgid ""
"How long the server waits (in seconds) for a response from a connecting or loading client before timing out.\n"
"Increase this if your friends take a long time to load into the game.\n"
"\n"
"Minimum: 30. (default: 30)"
msgstr ""
"Wie lange der Server (in Sekunden) auf eine Antwort eines verbindenden oder ladenden Clients wartet, bevor ein Timeout eintritt.\n"
"Erhöhen Sie diesen Wert, wenn Mitspieler länger zum Laden der Welt benötigen.\n"
"\n"
"Minimum: 30 (Standard: 30)"

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.PAUSE_SIM_ON_PLAYER_DISCONNECT
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.PAUSE_SIM_ON_PLAYER_DISCONNECT
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.PAUSE_SIM_ON_PLAYER_DISCONNECT
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.PAUSE_SIM_ON_PLAYER_DISCONNECT"
msgid "Automatically pauses the simulation when a player disconnects from the server."
msgstr "Pausiert die Simulation automatisch, wenn ein Spieler die Verbindung zum Server trennt."

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.SERVER_TICK_RATE
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.SERVER_TICK_RATE
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.SERVER_TICK_RATE
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.HOST_SETTINGS.SERVER_SETTINGS.SERVER_TICK_RATE"
msgid ""
"How many times per second the server processes incoming network messages.\n"
"Higher values reduce latency but increase CPU and bandwidth usage.\n"
"\n"
"Range: 20â128 TPS (default: 60)"
msgstr ""
"Wie oft pro Sekunde der Server eingehende Netzwerknachrichten verarbeitet.\n"
"Höhere Werte verringern Latenz, erhöhen jedoch CPU- und Bandbreitennutzung.\n"
"\n"
"Bereich: 20–128 TPS (Standard: 60)"

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.MAX_MESSAGES_PER_POLL"
msgid ""
"STEAMWORKS ONLY:\n"
"Maximum number of incoming Steam networking messages processed per poll tick on the client.\n"
"Higher values reduce input and state update latency under heavy network load but may increase per-frame CPU usage.\n"
"Lower values improve frame stability but can cause message backlog and delayed processing during traffic spikes.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended range: 8â64 (default: 16)"
msgstr ""
"NUR STEAMWORKS:\n"
"Maximale Anzahl eingehender Steam-Netzwerknachrichten, die pro Tick auf dem Client verarbeitet werden.\n"
"Höhere Werte reduzieren Eingabe- und Zustandsverzögerungen bei hoher Netzwerklast, können aber die CPU-Last erhöhen.\n"
"\n"
"Empfohlener Bereich: 8–64 (Standard: 16)"

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.CLIENT_SETTINGS.TIMEOUT_SECONDS"
msgid ""
"How long the client waits (in seconds) for a response from the server before timing out.\n"
"Increase this if you are timing out while trying to connect.\n"
"\n"
"Minimum: 30. (default: 30)"
msgstr ""
"Wie lange der Client (in Sekunden) auf eine Serverantwort wartet, bevor ein Timeout eintritt.\n"
"Erhöhen Sie diesen Wert bei Verbindungsproblemen.\n"
"\n"
"Minimum: 30 (Standard: 30)"

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.ENABLE_PACKET_QUEUE
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.ENABLE_PACKET_QUEUE
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.ENABLE_PACKET_QUEUE
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.ENABLE_PACKET_QUEUE"
msgid ""
"When enabled, outgoing packets are queued and sent at a limited rate per frame to prevent network saturation.\n"
"When disabled, all packets are sent immediately without throttling."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiviert, werden ausgehende Pakete in einer Warteschlange gesammelt und mit begrenzter Rate gesendet, um das Netzwerk nicht zu überlasten.\n"
"Wenn deaktiviert, werden alle Pakete sofort gesendet."

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND"
msgid ""
"Maximum number of packets to send per second per connection when the packet queue is enabled.\n"
"Excess packets are buffered and sent in subsequent frames.\n"
"\n"
"Ranges: (500 - 1000)"
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl an Paketen, die pro Sekunde und Verbindung gesendet werden, wenn die Paket-Warteschlange aktiv ist.\n"
"\n"
"Bereich: (500 - 1000)"

#. ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.BYPASS_PROTOCOL_CHECKS
#. STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.BYPASS_PROTOCOL_CHECKS
#. ONI_Together.MP_STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.BYPASS_PROTOCOL_CHECKS
msgctxt "ONI_Together.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.NETWORK_SETTINGS.BYPASS_PROTOCOL_CHECKS"
msgid ""
"Ignores protocol version, packet registry fingerprint, and mod version mismatches during connection handshake.\n"
"\n"
"Use this only for cross-platform testing between Debug and Release builds."
msgstr ""
"Ignoriert Versionsunterschiede von Protokoll, Paket-Fingerabdruck und Mod-Version beim Verbindungsaufbau.\n"
"\n"
"Nur für Entwicklungs- und Testzwecke verwenden."

